PLAN banking_cyclic
VERSION 2.0

GRAPH ingest
  MP: graphs/test_mega/ingest.mp
  PRIORITY: HIGH

GRAPH enrich
  MP: graphs/test_mega/enrich.mp
  DEPENDS: ingest

GRAPH report
  MP: graphs/test_mega/report.mp
  DEPENDS: enrich

GRAPH feedback
  MP: graphs/test_mega/feedback.mp
  DEPENDS: report, ingest
  SCHEDULE: CYCLIC
  MAX_ITERATIONS: 10
  CONVERGENCE: delta < 0.01
